 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "LORD, you have searched me and you know me",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.57,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You know when I sit down and when I rise",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You discern my thoughts from far away",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.94,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "You are familiar with all my ways",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 3.07,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Search me, O God, and know my heart",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 5.63,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Test me and know my anxious thoughts",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 3.36,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "See if there is any offensive way in me",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 3.21,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And lead me in the way everlasting",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 6.07,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "I tried to run where the dark is deep",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 8.37,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Where the sea runs out and the shadows sleep",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 7.89,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "I rode the wings of the early dawn",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 9.09,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "But your hand was there as I travelled on",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 9.25,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Even the darkness is not dark to you",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 11.37,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "The night shines like the day",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 13.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Search me, O God, and know my heart",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 16.91,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Test me and know my anxious thoughts",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 15.6,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "See if there is any offensive way in me",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 10.07,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And lead me in the way everlasting",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 11.11,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Before my mother knew my face",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 15.45,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "You knit me in a hidden place",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 16.02,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "You wove my frame where no eye could look",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 14.84,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And wrote my days into your book",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 11.4,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "I praise you, for I am awesomely and wonderfully made",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 13.26,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Your works are wonderful; my soul knows it well",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 20.19,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "How precious to me are your thoughts, O God!",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 24.04,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "How vast is their number!",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 23.58,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "If I could count them, they would outnumber the grains of sand",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 19.27,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
